HoneNode experimental host-agent RPM
===================================

This package contains only the prebuilt honed host broker and its systemd
integration. It does not contain, install, configure, or start the honenode
application. It is not a HoneNode product release.

Installation creates the honenode group and the /etc/honenode, /run/honenode,
and /var/lib/honenode directories. It does not enable, start, or restart any
service. Uninstall does not stop the service, remove the group, delete policy,
or delete retained state.

The service defaults to an empty HONE_TENANTS allowlist. No tenant is
provisioned. /etc/honenode/policy.json is deliberately absent: provisioning
and activation fail closed until a root operator installs and reviews a
version-1 policy. Optional overrides belong in /etc/honenode/honed.env.

Do not start integration testing until host dependencies, tenant policy,
capacity limits, listener/edge design, operator bootstrap, and an SELinux
policy have been reviewed. Keep SELinux enforcing. See the packaging README
in the source tree for the build gate and current blockers.
